Stay Alive is a horror, mystery film directed by William Brent Bell.

3
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:18,000
After the brutal death of a friend, a group of friends find themselves in possession of a video-game called
"Stay Alive," a blood-curdling true story of a 17th century noblewoman known as the Blood Countess.

4
00:22:56,000 --> 00:23:02,000
After playing the game when they know they shouldn't, however, the friends
realize that once they die in the game — they die for real!

