01:03:04,000 --> 01:03:10,000
Stay Alive is a 2006 American supernatural techno horror film directed by
William Brent Bell, who co-wrote it with Matthew Peterman.

12
01:08:48,000 --> 01:08:54,000
The film was produced by Joseph McGinty Nichol, and released on March
24, 2006, in the United States by Hollywood Pictures.

13
01:14:32,000 --> 01:14:38,000
The film explores themes of hacker, video game,
virtual reality, virtual fight, baroness.

14
01:20:16,000 --> 01:20:22,000
The tone is dark and mind_bending.
